</a>  </p><p> Where we used AI for research, we name the tool and the prompts and publish the full conversation. AI-reconstructed links used in the report were checked by hand.  <a href="https://techforpalestine.org/wikipedia-report-2026/appendix-c">
(Appendices C, D and E)
</a>  </p><p> Every claim in this report is footnoted, more than 500 in total.  </p> <p>
This is a living document. We update it when corrections or new information come in.
