</p> </div> <!-- Press (band): contact and downloadable material --> <div aria-labelledby="press-heading"> <h2 id="press-heading">Press</h2>  </div> <!-- Related T4P projects -->  <div aria-labelledby="report-cta-heading"> <p>Tech for Palestine is a member-driven organization that brings together people, skills and resources. Through technology and collaboration, our members build tools and solutions that support the movement for Palestine.</p><p>These projects include: protest apps, tools for boycotting, support for Palestinian students &amp; businesses, ethical tech alternatives, and many more.</p>  </div> </main>   </div></div>]]></description>
